content.text:
Now main US03 E2E. Need plan thoroughly and inspect E2E helper patterns in us01 for request interception etc. Need avoid modifying configs. baseURL 4200 default. Need Strapi URL env.

Need write 16 tests E01-E16. Need balance runtime. Current e2e baseline 21 tests ~ maybe 1-2 min. US03 will add maybe 16 tests. Need each uses page fixtures fresh context. Need helpers to complete Step1+select plan+reach summary, with mock plans/config if needed. Need route intercept for country-configs and form-fields. Need exact queries. Need use wildcard regex.

Need understand app's API requests sequence and selectors. Need maybe use live Strapi for most tests. For E05 edit terms/field label/option need route mocks (can't write Strapi). Intercept GET country-configs and form-fields, fulfill modified payload. Need parse request URL with URL. Need construct mock responses from live fetch? Could use request fixture via Playwright `request.get` to Strapi, modify. But easier define static config payload and field payload copied from seed. Need country-config payload shape. Need form-fields response shape. Need inspect catalogue.api mapping and seed fields to craft valid. Could intercept and modify response body from actual route using `route.fetch()` then parse JSON. That is robust and doesn't need static data. Use:
```
await page.route(/country-configs/, async route => {
 const response = await route.fetch();
 const json = await response.json();
 const row = json.data[0];
 row.termsAndConditions = ...
 await route.fulfill({ response, body: JSON.stringify(json), contentType:'application/json' });
});
```
But `route.fetch()` does actual request to backend; okay. Need `route.fulfill({ response, body })` supported. Or `status: response.status(), headers: response.headers(), body`. Good.

Need E07 blank terms: intercept config response and set terms '   ', then reach summary, assert blocking panel no pay, retry. For retry, need unroute then click Reintentar; route removed so live config returns. Need `page.unroute(CONFIG_ROUTE)` perhaps with same handler reference. Need manage.

Need E08 loading/error retry: intercept config route with delayed fulfill (500ms), navigate to summary. But Step1 load also calls config; if route set before completeStep1, it delays first load too. Better set route just before clicking Continuar? But `completeStep1` includes click and waits for plans page; after plans, route config for summary. Need route after plans loaded. Need use deferred promise to hold config response:
```
let release: (()=>void)|null ...
await page.route(CONFIG_ROUTE, async route => { await gate.promise; await route.continue(); });
await page.getByRole('button',{name:'Continuar'}).click();
expect URL summary
await expect(summary-loading).toBeVisible();
...
release();
